## 4️⃣ Verification & Acceptance Criteria  

| Criterion | How to Verify |
|-----------|---------------|
| **All tables exist** | Run `npm run db:sync` (or equivalent) and inspect the Postgres schema. |
| **API matches OpenAPI** | `npm run lint:openapi` and `npm test` (integration tests hitting each endpoint). |
| **Auth & RBAC enforced** | Attempt unauthorized requests; expect `401/403`. |
| **Audit logs created** | Perform state‑changing actions; query `/audit/logs` and verify entries. |
| **Review‑Credit calculations correct** | Create sample enrolments (use fixtures); call `/review-credit/export` and compare CSV to expected values. |
| **KPIs displayed** | Load Dashboard UI; numbers should reflect DB‑derived aggregates. |
| **Front‑End design meets premium criteria** | Visually check dark mode, glass‑morphism, smooth hover/animation, Google Font usage. |
| **Tests pass** | `npm run test` (backend) and `npm run test:ui` (frontend) both exit with 0. |
| **CI pipeline succeeds** | Push to a branch; GitHub Actions complete without failures. |
| **Documentation builds** | `npm run docs` produces a clean markdown site; links are clickable. |

